<title>POLAND: BFK preliminary 1996 group results. [CORRECTED 18:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>BFK preliminary 1996 group results. [CORRECTED 18:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFK SA preliminary results for the financial yer ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Corrects to show results are for whole year, not just final quarter.)</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit			51.99 vs    40.44</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			  43.86 vs    21.77</p>
<p>    group net profit				24.85 vs    12.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    group net sales				364.60 vs   319.07</p>
<p>    group costs of sales			 261.53 vs   254.26</p>
<p>    group extraordinary loss		     0.06 vs     0.11</p>
<p>    group income tax				19.71 vs     5.42</p>
<p>    group other taxes				0.00 vs     4.51</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		     5.55 vs     4.85</p>
<p>    group financial costs			 13.94 vs    23.55</p>
<p>    group investment				26.75 vs    32.33</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
